{"number":108,"nameArabic":"الكوثر","nameTransliterated":"Al-Kawthar","nameTranslated":"The Abundance","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":3,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"108:1","textAr":"إِنَّآ أَعۡطَيۡنَٰكَ ٱلۡكَوۡثَرَ","transliteration":"Inna aAAtaynaka alkawthara","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, We have granted you, [O Muhammad], al-Kawthar"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"(اے نبیؐ) ہم نے تمہیں کوثر عطا کر دیا"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"108:2","textAr":"فَصَلِّ لِرَبِّكَ وَٱنۡحَرۡ","transliteration":"Fasalli lirabbika wainhar","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So pray to your Lord and sacrifice [to Him alone]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس تم اپنے رب ہی کے لیے نماز پڑھو اور قربانی کرو"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"108:3","textAr":"إِنَّ شَانِئَكَ هُوَ ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ","transliteration":"Inna shaniaka huwa alabtaru","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تمہارا دشمن ہی جڑ کٹا ہے"}]}]}